    "My purchases seem to have been interpreted as broad interest in electronics, when I usually buy accessories to solve a particular connection or setup problem.",
    "My desktop expansion card purchase seems to have been stretched into interest in internal computer upgrades generally, even though adding USB ports does not imply I need new drives."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My most recent USB Ethernet adapter purchase makes extending wired connectivity more relevant than starting an unrelated entertainment or storage setup.",
    "I interact infrequently and need a concrete reason to buy: even a familiar accessory such as a cable or headset needs to match a current connection, length or replacement requirement."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognized my practical accessory interests but often missed the specific connectivity need that makes an item worth choosing now."
}
